olas, farmácias, academias, restaurantes e ao Parque Bacacheri. Há previsão de parque linear com ciclovias, iluminação e áreas verdes em frente ao condomínio.\n\nFinanciamento disponível pela Caixa Econômica Federal.  \nEntrega prevista para novembro de 2026.\n\nEntre em contato e agende sua visita.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b72de604-aaeb-4578-bc6c-c9f8ad7f3040.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a273c6b4-7b90-4019-bfa9-7fcc94d7ff80.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f65c027e-d3cf-4203-b91d-1be10d4ce35d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bf415f3f-ddef-4de2-b27f-ec6fa7f98f14.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4dd62576-901b-4907-8887-e3dde55df1b6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a3c6c615-fcda-48f7-8601-be254e437ffb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1244670f-28b9-4030-bc47-b207ced0e2e2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0879f7d8-fd36-402e-b558-5f63980ced38.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f020a577-87cf-4642-8620-4fada57e7aea.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7b9ee3c0-61a5-4838-b7fc-d74121b5e9bb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aee189d2dbdb29643b01e8b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/48bd7944-f752-4ff2-9b31-e751c1f2473b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.co